IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT domain
IMPORT `g1-first-schedule`
IMPORT `g1-interpretation`
IMPORT `g1-licensing-duty`

-- g1-tests-licensing.l4: tests of g1-licensing-duty.l4 (ss.3 and 4).  Group G1.  Generated from a table of scenarios kept in the encoder's work directory (not part of the deposit);
-- the assertions below are the record of the expected values, decided from the text of ss.2, 3 and 4 and of the
-- First Schedule as printed (inputs/law.wiki lines 40 to 76 and 466 to 561) before any rule was run.
-- Reading of the table: a licence kind is APPROPRIATE if it covers the system's capacity (grade 1 up to 18 kW, grade 2 up to 70 kW,
-- grade 3 any; the limits included) and the First Schedule lists the activity under it (every activity under all three kinds,
-- except B.3(2) and B.3(3), which only grade 3 lists).  No appropriate kind in force: item (1) of the Third Schedule if no licence
-- is in force at all, item (2) if some is but none appropriate.  An appropriate kind with a breached condition, a restriction or a
-- breached provision: forbidden, priced by no item (trap T12).

§ `Tests of Chapter 2: ss.3 and 4`

§§ `s.3(a): the cases`

`a system of 10 kW` MEANS `Cooling system` WITH `cooling capacity in kilowatts` IS 10, `refrigerants` IS EMPTY
`a system of 18 kW` MEANS `Cooling system` WITH `cooling capacity in kilowatts` IS 18, `refrigerants` IS EMPTY
`a system of 18.01 kW` MEANS `Cooling system` WITH `cooling capacity in kilowatts` IS 18.01, `refrigerants` IS EMPTY
`a system of 70 kW` MEANS `Cooling system` WITH `cooling capacity in kilowatts` IS 70, `refrigerants` IS EMPTY
`a system of 70.01 kW` MEANS `Cooling system` WITH `cooling capacity in kilowatts` IS 70.01, `refrigerants` IS EMPTY
`a system of 1000 kW` MEANS `Cooling system` WITH `cooling capacity in kilowatts` IS 1000, `refrigerants` IS EMPTY
`a system of 50 kW` MEANS `Cooling system` WITH `cooling capacity in kilowatts` IS 50, `refrigerants` IS EMPTY
`a system of 500 kW` MEANS `Cooling system` WITH `cooling capacity in kilowatts` IS 500, `refrigerants` IS EMPTY
`a system of 0 kW` MEANS `Cooling system` WITH `cooling capacity in kilowatts` IS 0, `refrigerants` IS EMPTY
`a system of minus 5 kW` MEANS `Cooling system` WITH `cooling capacity in kilowatts` IS 0 MINUS 5, `refrigerants` IS EMPTY
`a system of 100000 kW` MEANS `Cooling system` WITH `cooling capacity in kilowatts` IS 100000, `refrigerants` IS EMPTY

`facts with neither limit satisfied` MEANS `Facts about an act for the limits of First Schedule items` WITH
    `the parts connected are integral control and monitoring accessories only` IS FALSE
    `the electrical work is done in the integral electrical system only` IS FALSE

`facts with the accessories limit satisfied` MEANS `Facts about an act for the limits of First Schedule items` WITH
    `the parts connected are integral control and monitoring accessories only` IS TRUE
    `the electrical work is done in the integral electrical system only` IS FALSE

`facts with the electrical limit satisfied` MEANS `Facts about an act for the limits of First Schedule items` WITH
    `the parts connected are integral control and monitoring accessories only` IS FALSE
    `the electrical work is done in the integral electrical system only` IS TRUE

